<title>MEXICO: Mexican stocks surge to record close.</title>
<headline>Mexican stocks surge to record close.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks raced to a record close Tuesday as investors welcomed a government economic plan that laid out ambitious goals for growth, traders said.</p>
<p>The leading IPC index closed at a preliminary level of 4,060.64, up 1.44 percent.</p>
<p>Volume was a healthy 129 million shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The economic plan helped the market most,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
